cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or the RSCP protocol, please cite the paper."
title: "RSCP: Residual-Stream Contamination Probing"
abstract: >-
  Reference implementation of the RSCP protocol, a level-matched placebo
  baseline for detecting benchmark contamination from a model's residual
  stream. Includes the statistical core, the Phase 0c validation study, two
  generative simulators, the item-set builders, and the Phase 1 nuisance
  audit of published membership-inference splits.
type: software
license: MIT
authors:
